    {
      "id": "claim_8a150cb281ba455dba01ca1a521dc9b6",
      "statement": "Cell acquisition is performed only via conditional bucket writes — create when absent or compare-and-swap against the previous record — so the object store itself decides which of two contender nodes wins and two nodes cannot both acquire one cell.",
